# Do not use Compose

This app is Views + XML only.

- Do not add Compose dependencies (`compose-bom`, `androidx.compose.*`, `activity-compose`).
- Do not create `@Composable` functions, Compose themes, or `setContent { }`.
- Do not enable `buildFeatures { compose = true }`.
- New screens use XML layouts, view binding, and COUI widgets.

```kotlin
// BAD
setContent { SearchHomeScreen() }

// GOOD
binding = ActivitySearchHomeBinding.inflate(layoutInflater)
setContentView(binding.root)
```
